---
import DocsLayout from '~/layouts/DocsLayout.astro'
---

<DocsLayout slug="clients/go" title="Go client" description="go get github.com/kotoshu/kotoshu-go — the Go client over the HTTP API: check, suggest, detect, correct, all context-aware.">
  <p class="docs-lead">
    A single dependency-free package over the HTTP API — every method takes a
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">context.Context</code> first, the Go way.
  </p>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Install</h2>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4"><code>go get github.com/kotoshu/kotoshu-go@v0.1.0</code></pre>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Quick start</h2>
  <p class="text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-2)] mt-4">
    Point the client at a running <a href="/docs/clients/http" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">kotoshu-server</a>:
  </p>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4" is:raw><code>package main

import (
	"context"
	"fmt"

	kotoshu "github.com/kotoshu/kotoshu-go"
)

func main() {
	ctx := context.Background()
	client, _ := kotoshu.New("http://127.0.0.1:9292", kotoshu.WithLanguage("en"))

	result, _ := client.Check(ctx, "helo wrold", nil)
	for _, e := range result.Errors {
		fmt.Println(e.Word, "->", e.Suggestions[:3])
	}

	sugs, _ := client.Suggest(ctx, "recieve", &kotoshu.SuggestOptions{Max: 3})
	for _, s := range sugs {
		fmt.Println("suggest:", s.Word)
	}

	ok, _ := client.Correct(ctx, "hello", nil)
	fmt.Println("correct:", ok)
}</code></pre>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4"><code>helo -> [hello help hell]
wrold -> [world wold weld]
suggest: receive
suggest: relieve
suggest: recife
correct: true</code></pre>
  <p class="text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-2)] mt-4">
    Options configure the client once:
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">WithLanguage("en")</code> sets the default
    language, <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">WithTimeout(30 * time.Second)</code>
    the HTTP timeout, <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">WithHTTPClient(...)</code>
    injects your own <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">*http.Client</code>.
    Per-call options (<code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">*CheckOptions</code>,
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">*SuggestOptions</code>) override the defaults —
    pass <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">nil</code> to accept them.
  </p>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Errors</h2>
  <p class="text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-2)] mt-4">
    Server errors come back as <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">*kotoshu.APIError</code>
    with <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">.Code</code> and
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">.Message</code>;
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">kotoshu.IsResourceNotSetup(err)</code> tests the
    422 case — the language is not set up on the server.
  </p>

  <p class="dict-anno mt-10 border-t border-[var(--color-border-subtle)] pt-5">
    Verified 2026-09-05 — the quick start executed against kotoshu-go v0.1.0 on Go 1.26.
    Registry:
    <a href="https://github.com/kotoshu/kotoshu-go" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">kotoshu-go repo</a> ·
    <a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/kotoshu/kotoshu-go" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">pkg.go.dev reference</a>
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
